<% content_for :title, "Konfimasyon Relasyon Fanmi" %>

<div style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif; color:#101828;">
  <div style="margin:0 0 10px;">
    <div style="font-family:'Montserrat','Inter',Arial,sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:18px; color:#00209F; margin:0;">
      Konfimasyon Relasyon Fanmi
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin:14px 0 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 10px;">
      Onè, <strong><%= @relative.first_name %> <%= @relative.last_name %></strong>,
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- KREYÒL -->
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
         style="margin:0 0 12px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:14px;
                border:1px solid rgba(0,32,159,0.16); overflow:hidden;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:14px; background:#f7f9ff;">
        <div style="font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.6px; color:#1b2559; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:900;">
          Kreyol
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:8px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#101828;">
          <strong><%= @citizen.first_name %> <%= @citizen.last_name %></strong>
          deklare nan sistèm BonID a ke ou se <strong><%= @relationship %></strong> li.
          <br><br>
          Èske ou konfime enfòmasyon sa a?
          <br><br>
          Lè ou aksepte, sa ap pèmèt <strong><%= @citizen.first_name %></strong> wè lyen fanmi sa a nan dosye ofisyèl li.
          Sèvis sivil, anbasad, ak tribinal ap ka verifye relasyon sa a dijitalman.
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- ENGLISH -->
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
         style="margin:10px 0 12px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:14px;
                border:1px solid rgba(0,32,159,0.18); overflow:hidden;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:14px; background:#f7f9ff;">
        <div style="font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.6px; color:#1b2559; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:900;">
          English
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:8px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#101828;">
          <strong><%= @citizen.first_name %> <%= @citizen.last_name %></strong>
          has declared in the BonID system that you are their <strong><%= @family_member.relationship %></strong>.
          <br><br>
          Do you confirm this information?
          <br><br>
          By accepting, <strong><%= @citizen.first_name %></strong> will be able to show this family link
          in their official records. Civil services, embassies, and courts will be able to verify this relationship digitally.
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- ACTION BUTTONS -->
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:16px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:0 0 8px;">
        <a href="<%= @confirm_url %>"
           style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 32px; border-radius:999px;
                  background:#00209F; color:#ffffff; font-weight:700; font-size:14px;
                  font-family:'Montserrat','Inter',Arial,sans-serif;
                  text-decoration:none;">
          Wi, se pitit mwen / Yes, confirm
        </a>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:8px 0 0;">
        <a href="<%= @deny_url %>"
           style="display:inline-block; padding:10px 28px; border-radius:999px;
                  background:#f2f4f7; color:#344054; font-weight:600; font-size:13px;
                  font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;
                  text-decoration:none; border:1px solid #d0d5dd;">
          Non, se pa pitit mwen / No, deny
        </a>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- SAFETY WARNING -->
  <div style="margin-top:12px; padding:10px; background:#fffbeb; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #fde68a;">
    <div style="font-size:12px; color:#92400e; line-height:1.5;">
      Si ou pa konnen moun sa a, tanpri inore mesaj sa a. Pèsonn pa ka jwenn aksè nan done ou san ou pa konfime.
      <br>
      If you don't recognize this person, please ignore this email. No one can access your data without your confirmation.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:16px; font-size:13px; color:#475467;">
    Mèsi anpil / Thank you,
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:6px; font-size:13px; color:#475467;">
    — BonID Team
  </div>
</div>
